OL,3,GNEWSAThief beat grandad to death after 
OL,4,Astealing #5k                           
OL,6,FA man who beat a 71-year-old           
OL,7,Fgrandfather to death after stealing    
OL,8,Fthousands of pounds from him has been  
OL,9,Ffound guilty of murder.                
OL,11,FJohn Mills, 46, beat John Boyle to     
OL,12,Fdeath while he was lying in bed at his 
OL,13,Fflat in Kettering, Northamptonshire, on
OL,14,F26 October 2025.                       
OL,16,FDuring a three-week trial, Mills, of   
OL,17,FMarriott Street in Northampton,        
OL,18,Frepeatedly denied killing Boyle, being 
OL,19,Fpresent at the time of his death or    
OL,20,Fknowing who was responsible.           
