OL,3,GNEWSAThief beat grandad to death after 
OL,4,Astealing #5k                           
OL,6,FAccording to police, Mills had         
OL,7,Fbefriended Boyle ten days before       
OL,8,Fkilling him, stealing money from him in
OL,9,Fan attempt to impress his girlfriend.  
OL,10,FHe will be sentenced in February.      
